@startuml
title Active Replication

box "Master Node"
participant Master
end box

box "Replica Nodes"
participant Replica1
participant Replica2
end box

alt Active Replication
Master -> Replica1: Log Entry (Immediate)
Replica1 -> Replica1: Verify Schema Compatibility
Master -> Replica2: Log Entry (Immediate)
Replica2 -> Replica2: Verify Schema Compatibility
else Schema Mismatch
Master -> Replica1: Halt Replication, Report Error
Master -> Replica2: Halt Replication, Report Error
else CREATE/DROP Operations
Master -> Replica1: Update Schema + Apply Changes
Master -> Replica2: Update Schema + Apply Changes
end

note left of Replica2
  1. Replica nodes ensure schema compatibility for all changes, except CREATE/DROP operations.
  2. Replica configuration (connection details) stored in nodes.json, which simplifies node management.
end note

@enduml